ly</span>:             If they have a miniature horse sculpture in the gift shop, I'm going to buy it! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:         After this, are we going to go for lunch? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:             Yes, I made reservations.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le16ob03re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le16ob03re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}